ht: 131px;\" width=\"150\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My Fiance and his groomsmen will be wearing this\u00a0the dark gray vest and pants except they'll have\u00a0purple ties! Im pretty excited about it! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Melimelvi86@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1332360842,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253020.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Melimelvi86","Id":253020,"Name":"Melimelvi86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c34018ae7f8d4f4f67629e1ca2a861ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; There is a thread dedicated to this, i guess it just depends on what words you were using in your search.&amp;nbsp; Any-who, here you go:&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/1058\/post-groom-and-gm-attire\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/1058\/post-groom-and-gm-attire&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1686218,"PostDate":1352942856,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\