n&#039;t care WHAT he wears (within reason, of course).&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832283,"PostDate":1391714775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think khaki's and a philippino dres shirt (his choice).\u00a0 I may change my mind as the date draws closer, but I really don't care WHAT he wears (within reason, of course).<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellis_baby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.222.71.55","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1386903765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275607.jpg?_r=1425326341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellisbaby","Id":275607,"Name":"kellisbaby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.197.53.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0e5f1a9e6c0da6ce640c4b1683e446f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Grey pants and vest...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832292,"PostDate":1391715226,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Grey pants and vest...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandiesueb@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"38.99.122.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388883717,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275879.jpg?_r=1431174019","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Mandiesue","Id":275879,"Name":"Mandiesue","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.183.226.155","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8b425855791959523fcc186d66e3a15","RawContent":"My FH is wearing khaki shorts and a dress shirt. We are having a very casual ceremony. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1836197,"PostDate":1393731806,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My FH is wearing khaki shorts and a dress shirt. We are having a very casual ceremony. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cindydegrace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.183.226.155","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382587384,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274523.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cindyd","Id":274523,"Name":"cindyd","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"79.160.23.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79464f71b7c982839372f42289787a26","RawContent":"My husband-to-be (wow, that&#039;s still weird to say) will be wearing almost all black despite the heat and tropical feel (he&#039;s a really cool type, and would look really weird in flip flops and linen pants). He&#039;ll be wearing black shoes with blue socks, superdark tight blue jeans (almost black), a black shirt with the sleeves rolled up, a blue tie, and a black vest. Out wedding colors are different shades of blue, green and ivory :) His boutonni\u00e8re is going to be two green orchids with a blue ribbon.","Attachments":[],"Id":1836843,"PostDate":1394051414,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My husband-to-be (wow, that's still weird to say) will be wearing almost all black despite the heat and tropical feel (he's a really cool type, and would look really weird in flip flops and linen pants). He'll be wearing black shoes with blue socks, superdark tight blue jeans (almost black), a black shirt with the sleeves rolled up, a blue tie, and a black vest. Out wedding colors are different shades of blue, green and ivory <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> His boutonni\u00e8re is going to be two green orchids with a blue ribbon.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"July 14th 2014, Taveuni Island, Fiji ","Email":"lilyaltier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"79.160.23.45","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393677963,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276952.jpg?_r=1393789452","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LilyPotter","Id":276952,"Name":"LilyPotter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.100.120.102","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":70637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68edda7cea47b8480a1d8c5493f95bf8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My FI will be wearing beige linen pants and white button down. &amp;nbsp; Causal!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837659,"PostDate":1394574384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My FI will be wearing beige linen pants and white button down. \u00a0 Causal!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roesslerwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.100.120.102","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384963426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUr