{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":14,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":6266,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1515365,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":234504,"Name":"monicak","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234504.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":298,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1315309065,"LastPoster":{"Id":271760,"Name":"KeissyS","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271760.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":37,"Preview":{"Id":1515365,"PostDate":1315309065,"PostContent":"Hello Ladies!\u00a0 Dan and I were recently married on July 20, 2011 at the Riu Palace Punta Cana\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"monicakav@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1291906650,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234504.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":298,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"monicak","Id":234504,"Name":"monicak","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63342,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32fad2d060602b13d0ffa15c8499c243","RawContent":"&lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_146\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_145\" style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_144\" style=\"color: #000000\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_143\" style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Hello Ladies!&amp;nbsp; Dan and I were recently married on July 20, 2011 at the Riu Palace Punta Cana\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s beach gazebo at 5:00 p.m.&amp;nbsp; Our reception was held at La Altagracia from 6:30 p.m. until midnight.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;We had thirty guests join us as we celebrated our new life together.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_152\" style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_151\" style=\"color: #000000\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_150\" style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Thanks to so many of you for your ideas, contacts and reviews which helped make our day so special.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_134\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_139\" style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_138\" style=\"color: #000000\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_137\" style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;a class=\"dispatcher-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/d2\/d28a1846_www.antillanafoto.com-301.jpeg\" id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_136\" target=\"_blank\" vglnk_1315308801297=\"1\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-301.jpg\" height=\"233\" id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_135\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/d2\/350x700px-LL-d28a1846_www.antillanafoto.com-301.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 233px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_133\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_129\"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #000000\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Planning -&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_132\" style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_131\" style=\"color: #000000\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_130\" style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt; I had vacationed with my family at the Riu Palace Punta Cana in June 2010 and had just recently gotten engaged in May.&amp;nbsp; I actually stumbled on a wedding taking place and knew instantly this is where we would get married.&amp;nbsp; I made an appointment with the Wedding Manager &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Maria del Carmen Cris\u00b3stomo &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_128\" style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_127\" style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;and took down her email address in case I decided to move forward with the planning after discussing it with Dan.&amp;nbsp; In January 2011, we decided the resort was perfect and wanted to move forward with our destination wedding in Punta Cana.&amp;nbsp; I wanted to pick a resort I had visited so I could answer my guests\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 questions and know exactly what to expect versus walking into it blindly.&amp;nbsp; Within four to five weeks of exchanging emails with Maria, the majority of our wedding was planned.&amp;nbsp; She was quick to respond to my questions and always attached multiple photos.&amp;nbsp; We wanted a Private Reception at the Steakhouse, DJ, MC, Premium Bar Setup, Ceremony at the Beach Gazebo and Pastor York to perform the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; We went with the \"house vendors\" with the exception of Pastor York.&amp;nbsp; We had ordered and then mailed our wedding invitations to our guests by the last week of February.&amp;nbsp; A few weeks later, I had purchased my wedding dress at &lt;em&gt;Alfred Angelo&lt;\/em&gt;, the groom and groomsmen suits at &lt;em&gt;Professional Image&lt;\/em&gt; and ordered all of the bridesmaids dresses from &lt;em&gt;David\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bridal&lt;\/em&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;a class=\"dispatcher-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/1e\/1e7c7b5f_www.antillanafoto.com-290.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-290.jpg\" height=\"525\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/1e\/350x700px-LL-1e7c7b5f_www.antillanafoto.com-290.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 525px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #000000\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Arrival - &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;We arrived at the Riu on Sunday, July 17&lt;sup&gt;th &lt;\/sup&gt;and left for our honeymoon on Friday, July 22&lt;sup&gt;nd&lt;\/sup&gt;.&amp;nbsp; The resort\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s policy required that we arrive 2 full business days prior to the wedding date.&amp;nbsp; We had no issues with our flights from Boston and Check-in at the resort was a breeze.&amp;nbsp; All of our guests had a smooth travel and check-in was also quick for them.&amp;nbsp; Dan and I flew American Airlines as they were the only airline that would allow me to carryon my dress and hang it in a coat closet.&amp;nbsp; As soon as they saw the dress, they immediately offered the closet in first-class.&amp;nbsp; Shortly, after we arrived, I saw Maria in the lobby and quickly said hello.&amp;nbsp; My fianc\u00a9 and I were scheduled to meet with her at 10:00 a.m. the next morning to start confirming the wedding details.&amp;nbsp; All of our guests were so impressed with the resort from the minute they pulled up and couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t believe this was where we were getting married.&amp;nbsp; The grounds are beautiful, the beach is spectacular, and the staff is so kind. Our guests started arriving Sunday all the way through Wednesday afternoon.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Meetings -&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt; The next morning Maria had us confirm the flowers, wedding cake, ribbon color for the white covered chairs, reception and ceremony setups.&amp;nbsp; We met for about an hour and were able to quickly confirm everything.&amp;nbsp; My bridesmaids were wearing the color Guava and guys were in Khaki suits.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;We were able to quickly choose gold, orange and ivory tones to match our color scheme.&amp;nbsp; We also met with the photographers from &lt;em&gt;Antillana de Fotografia SRL &lt;\/em&gt;that are located on the Riu property and chose the Pearl Package.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Esther Fuentes&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt; was so sweet and made notes of the shots that I \u00e2\u20ac\u0153had to have.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d&amp;nbsp; She explained how the \u00bd of the photographers would be in my room and the other \u00bd with my fianc\u00a9 as he was getting ready.&amp;nbsp; They photographed us getting ready with family &amp;amp; friends, during the ceremony, a beach photo shoot, at the reception and photographed the bridal party around the resort.&amp;nbsp; I LOVE my pictures, everyone who has seen them loves them too and I get compliments how artistic my photographers were.&amp;nbsp; The team was excellent, Suri and Nico did an amazing job of capturing the beautiful shots \u00e2\u20ac\u201c I can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t thank them enough.&amp;nbsp; I ended up buying all of the photos \u00e2\u20ac\u201c my package included 150 prints and 150 on a photo DVD.&amp;nbsp; I ended up with 515 photos and purchased the remaining 365 photos on the photo DVD.&amp;nbsp; My package included a coffee table book where the photos are printed right on the page.&amp;nbsp; The video DVD captures me getting ready all the way through the end of the night dancing at the reception.&amp;nbsp; Finally, we met with the DJ and MC with &lt;em&gt;Eventos FJ&lt;\/em&gt; who are two of the nicest guys you will ever meet.&amp;nbsp; They are so much fun and had so much energy, which is exactly what we wanted for the reception.&amp;nbsp; We reviewed our playlists, confirmed everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s last names and stressed we wanted everyone up and dancing all night.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;a class=\"dispatcher-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/1c\/1cbcbe52_www.antillanafoto.com-394.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-394.jpg\" height=\"526\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/1c\/350x700px-LL-1cbcbe52_www.antillanafoto.com-394.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 526px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Wedding Day &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;\u00e2\u20ac\u201c That morning was really relaxing and stress-free for us and our guests.&amp;nbsp; I had confirmed all of the hair appointments with the spa for the bridesmaids, mothers and myself.&amp;nbsp; After breakfast a majority of the guests ended up on the beach with us.&amp;nbsp; I had my hair appointment for a wash &amp;amp; blow-dry at the spa @ 12:30 p.m.&amp;nbsp; The women at the spa are wonderful; Jaime is the manager and is very take-charge and organized.&amp;nbsp; After heading back to my room from the spa, I ordered room service for lunch with lots of extras for the ladies including sandwiches, salads, cake and champagne.&amp;nbsp; Elizabeth blow dried my hair and came to my room around 3:30 p.m. to style my hair and apply my makeup.&amp;nbsp; The bridesmaids got ready in their own rooms after their hair was done at the Spa and then all met in my room to put on their jewelry.&amp;nbsp; At about 4:00 p.m., the photographers and videographer arrived to my room and so did the flowers.&amp;nbsp; They took photos of the rings, flowers, Elizabeth finishing up my makeup, and my mom and godmother tying the back of my dress.&amp;nbsp; We took pictures outside with the bridesmaids as my fianc\u00a9 was taking his photos with the groomsmen on a different floor of the resort.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;a class=\"dispatcher-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/09\/09207257_www.antillanafoto.com-4.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-4.jpg\" height=\"526\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/09\/350x700px-LL-09207257_www.antillanafoto.com-4.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 526px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Ceremony \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Beach Gazebo &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Thanks to a BestDestinationWedding.com I read about and then hired &lt;em&gt;Pastor Rick York&lt;\/em&gt; to officiate the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; It was important to us to have our ceremony in English as we didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to have it translated.&amp;nbsp; Pastor York had emailed me a few ceremonies and we chose the Traditional Ceremony which was beautiful.&amp;nbsp; Dan\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s sister and my brother each did a reading.&amp;nbsp; We also brought a Unity Sand set and Pastor York incorporated that into the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; He was funny and a natural and all of our guests adored him.&amp;nbsp; I highly recommend Pastor York!&amp;nbsp; As I was making my way to the gazebo, there were hundreds of people looking on and surrounding the gazebo which made me feel even more special.&amp;nbsp; It seemed like I had 300 guests versus 30 and they were all so kind wishing us luck and taking photos.&amp;nbsp; I have to check if I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m on You -Tube &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: wingdings\"&gt;J&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;&amp;nbsp; I had given Maria a wedding ceremony song CD and she knew which songs to play as members of our bridal party were walking down the aisle \u00e2\u20ac\u201c it was magical.&amp;nbsp; After the ceremony, we made our way to the beach for pictures!&amp;nbsp; We did group photos, family photos, bridal party photos, and just the bride &amp;amp; groom photos.&amp;nbsp; This was so much fun and the list of poses I \u00e2\u20ac\u0153had to have\u00e2\u20ac\u009d were harder to reenact than I thought \u00e2\u20ac\u201c lol.&amp;nbsp; I love the shots that photographers got.&amp;nbsp; As we were taking our photos, the rest of our guests made their way to the lobby to cool off.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_170\"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;a class=\"dispatcher-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/9\/9b\/9b75f4b8_www.antillanafoto.com-217.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-217.jpg\" height=\"233\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/9\/9b\/350x700px-LL-9b75f4b8_www.antillanafoto.com-217.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 233px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_173\"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Details \u00e2\u20ac\u201c&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_172\" style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_171\" style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt; Through this website, I met graphic designer Kim Torres; her work is beautiful.&amp;nbsp; I had reached out to Kim earlier in the year as she had gotten married at the Riu Palace Punta Cana in October 2010.&amp;nbsp; I saw her work and hired her to create our Place Cards, Dinner Menus and Wedding Program.&amp;nbsp; I mailed her a swatch with the Guava color and she was able to match the color perfectly.&amp;nbsp; Everyone loved the wedding programs; she had a great idea to attach these on raffia fans which helped keep our guests cool and served as a favor too.&amp;nbsp; She is flexible, easy to work with, meets all of her deadlines, pays attention to detail and helped move me along through the planning.&amp;nbsp; She offered great tips and it was wonderful to get her opinion from her experience.&amp;nbsp; I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m now working with Kim to finish up my guest book.&amp;nbsp; Kim suggested purchasing postcards once I arrived in Punta Cana and having the guests each sign a postcard.&amp;nbsp; We also took a photo with each and every guest and will now incorporate these into the guestbook.&amp;nbsp; You can find Kim on Facebook and check out her work; she\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s amazing!&amp;nbsp; Her profile is listed as &lt;em&gt;KTorresDesig&lt;\/em&gt;n.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_174\"&gt; &lt;a class=\"dispatcher-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/5\/52\/529f805d_www.antillanafoto.com-392.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-392.jpg\" height=\"233\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/5\/52\/350x700px-LL-529f805d_www.antillanafoto.com-392.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 233px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Reception \u00e2\u20ac\u201c La Altagracia (Steakhouse) &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;Our guests made their way back down to the Steakhouse for the reception and took their seats; Maria had placed all of the Place Cards according to our seating arrangement.&amp;nbsp; The MC introduced the Bridal Party and we went right into our first dance.&amp;nbsp; This was immediately followed by the Father-Daughter dance and the Mother-Son dance.&amp;nbsp; We really wanted to get these out of the way as we knew this would be very emotional for our us and our parents.&amp;nbsp; After the dance, we all took our seats and the Restaurant Manager took everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s orders for Dinner.&amp;nbsp; While waiting for the appetizers to come, the Best Man and Maid of Honor gave their speeches.&amp;nbsp; The food was incredible; all of the guests loved it.&amp;nbsp; Appetizers included Seafood on Ice and Salad.&amp;nbsp; For the main course, our guests could choose from (1) Grilled Chicken (2) Rack of Lamb (3) Beef Rib Eye (4) Beef Tenderloin Land &amp;amp; Sea (Surf &amp;amp; Turf).&amp;nbsp; We both got Surf &amp;amp; Turf and it was delicious!&amp;nbsp; As for the wedding cake, Dan chose the flavor.&amp;nbsp; He went with Vanilla cake with a Guaba filling with small chunks of Mango in it.&amp;nbsp; I wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t sure how that was going to taste but it was incredible.&amp;nbsp; Everyone made sure to have a piece of cake at some point during the reception.&amp;nbsp; I chose to add an additional layer, which made it a 3-layer cake versus just two for an additional cost.&amp;nbsp; The DJ played songs off of our playlists but also threw in his own stuff, which we were happy with.&amp;nbsp; Our guests had requests and the DJ had all of the music.&amp;nbsp; At one point we had a Conga line; the MC got a stick and the entire staff and all my guests were doing the limbo.&amp;nbsp; We were having so much fun that we extended the reception for an hour and a half thanks to the DJ and restaurant staff.&amp;nbsp; After all of the non-stop dancing, everyone returned to their rooms and quickly showered and we all met up in the lobby for drinks and the party continued \u00e2\u20ac\u201c it was so much fun!&amp;nbsp; We really enjoyed the night and took it all in \u00e2\u20ac\u201c it was a blast! &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_119\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;a class=\"dispatcher-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/f0\/f007cc60_www.antillanafoto.com-443.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-443.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532470\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;The day after the wedding we walked to the Photo Shop on the Riu property and selected the 150 photos we wanted printed.&amp;nbsp; This is when we decided to upgrade our package and buy the additional photos for the photo DVD.&amp;nbsp; We stayed at the Riu until Friday afternoon, as we were promised our entire photo package and video.&amp;nbsp; Once we picked up everything, we headed to the Iberostar Grand for our honeymoon!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_153\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 11pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;a class=\"dispatcher-lightbox-open\" href=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/b4\/b4dd4de0_www.antillanafoto.com-422.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-422.jpg\" height=\"526\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/b4\/350x700px-LL-b4dd4de0_www.antillanafoto.com-422.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 526px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;!-- google_ad_section_end --&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1515365,"PostDate":1315309065,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_146\"> <span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_145\"  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_144\"  style=\"color: #000000\"><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_143\"  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Hello Ladies!\u00a0 Dan and I were recently married on July 20, 2011 at the Riu Palace Punta Cana\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s beach gazebo at 5:00 p.m.\u00a0 Our reception was held at La Altagracia from 6:30 p.m. until midnight.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">We had thirty guests join us as we celebrated our new life together.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_152\"  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_151\"  style=\"color: #000000\"><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_150\"  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Thanks to so many of you for your ideas, contacts and reviews which helped make our day so special.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_134\"> <span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_139\"  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_138\"  style=\"color: #000000\"><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_137\"  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/d2\/d28a1846_www.antillanafoto.com-301.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-301.jpg\" height=\"233\" id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_135\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/d\/d2\/350x700px-LL-d28a1846_www.antillanafoto.com-301.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 233px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_133\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_129\"> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"color: #000000\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Planning -<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_132\"  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_131\"  style=\"color: #000000\"><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_130\"  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"> I had vacationed with my family at the Riu Palace Punta Cana in June 2010 and had just recently gotten engaged in May.\u00a0 I actually stumbled on a wedding taking place and knew instantly this is where we would get married.\u00a0 I made an appointment with the Wedding Manager <\/span><\/span><\/span><em><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Maria del Carmen Cris\u00b3stomo <\/span><\/span><\/em><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_128\"  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_127\"  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">and took down her email address in case I decided to move forward with the planning after discussing it with Dan.\u00a0 In January 2011, we decided the resort was perfect and wanted to move forward with our destination wedding in Punta Cana.\u00a0 I wanted to pick a resort I had visited so I could answer my guests\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 questions and know exactly what to expect versus walking into it blindly.\u00a0 Within four to five weeks of exchanging emails with Maria, the majority of our wedding was planned.\u00a0 She was quick to respond to my questions and always attached multiple photos.\u00a0 We wanted a Private Reception at the Steakhouse, DJ, MC, Premium Bar Setup, Ceremony at the Beach Gazebo and Pastor York to perform the ceremony.\u00a0 We went with the \"house vendors\" with the exception of Pastor York.\u00a0 We had ordered and then mailed our wedding invitations to our guests by the last week of February.\u00a0 A few weeks later, I had purchased my wedding dress at <em>Alfred Angelo<\/em>, the groom and groomsmen suits at <em>Professional Image<\/em> and ordered all of the bridesmaids dresses from <em>David\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bridal<\/em>.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/1e\/1e7c7b5f_www.antillanafoto.com-290.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-290.jpg\" height=\"525\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/1e\/350x700px-LL-1e7c7b5f_www.antillanafoto.com-290.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 525px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"color: #000000\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Arrival - <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">We arrived at the Riu on Sunday, July 17<sup>th <\/sup>and left for our honeymoon on Friday, July 22<sup>nd<\/sup>.\u00a0 The resort\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s policy required that we arrive 2 full business days prior to the wedding date.\u00a0 We had no issues with our flights from Boston and Check-in at the resort was a breeze.\u00a0 All of our guests had a smooth travel and check-in was also quick for them.\u00a0 Dan and I flew American Airlines as they were the only airline that would allow me to carryon my dress and hang it in a coat closet.\u00a0 As soon as they saw the dress, they immediately offered the closet in first-class.\u00a0 Shortly, after we arrived, I saw Maria in the lobby and quickly said hello.\u00a0 My fianc\u00a9 and I were scheduled to meet with her at 10:00 a.m. the next morning to start confirming the wedding details.\u00a0 All of our guests were so impressed with the resort from the minute they pulled up and couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t believe this was where we were getting married.\u00a0 The grounds are beautiful, the beach is spectacular, and the staff is so kind. Our guests started arriving Sunday all the way through Wednesday afternoon.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Meetings -<\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"> The next morning Maria had us confirm the flowers, wedding cake, ribbon color for the white covered chairs, reception and ceremony setups.\u00a0 We met for about an hour and were able to quickly confirm everything.\u00a0 My bridesmaids were wearing the color Guava and guys were in Khaki suits.\u00a0 \u00a0We were able to quickly choose gold, orange and ivory tones to match our color scheme.\u00a0 We also met with the photographers from <em>Antillana de Fotografia SRL <\/em>that are located on the Riu property and chose the Pearl Package.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><em><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Esther Fuentes<\/span><\/span><\/em><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"> was so sweet and made notes of the shots that I \u00e2\u20ac\u0153had to have.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\u00a0 She explained how the \u00bd of the photographers would be in my room and the other \u00bd with my fianc\u00a9 as he was getting ready.\u00a0 They photographed us getting ready with family & friends, during the ceremony, a beach photo shoot, at the reception and photographed the bridal party around the resort.\u00a0 I LOVE my pictures, everyone who has seen them loves them too and I get compliments how artistic my photographers were.\u00a0 The team was excellent, Suri and Nico did an amazing job of capturing the beautiful shots \u00e2\u20ac\u201c I can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t thank them enough.\u00a0 I ended up buying all of the photos \u00e2\u20ac\u201c my package included 150 prints and 150 on a photo DVD.\u00a0 I ended up with 515 photos and purchased the remaining 365 photos on the photo DVD.\u00a0 My package included a coffee table book where the photos are printed right on the page.\u00a0 The video DVD captures me getting ready all the way through the end of the night dancing at the reception.\u00a0 Finally, we met with the DJ and MC with <em>Eventos FJ<\/em> who are two of the nicest guys you will ever meet.\u00a0 They are so much fun and had so much energy, which is exactly what we wanted for the reception.\u00a0 We reviewed our playlists, confirmed everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s last names and stressed we wanted everyone up and dancing all night.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/1c\/1cbcbe52_www.antillanafoto.com-394.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-394.jpg\" height=\"526\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/1\/1c\/350x700px-LL-1cbcbe52_www.antillanafoto.com-394.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 526px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Wedding Day <\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">\u00e2\u20ac\u201c That morning was really relaxing and stress-free for us and our guests.\u00a0 I had confirmed all of the hair appointments with the spa for the bridesmaids, mothers and myself.\u00a0 After breakfast a majority of the guests ended up on the beach with us.\u00a0 I had my hair appointment for a wash & blow-dry at the spa @ 12:30 p.m.\u00a0 The women at the spa are wonderful; Jaime is the manager and is very take-charge and organized.\u00a0 After heading back to my room from the spa, I ordered room service for lunch with lots of extras for the ladies including sandwiches, salads, cake and champagne.\u00a0 Elizabeth blow dried my hair and came to my room around 3:30 p.m. to style my hair and apply my makeup.\u00a0 The bridesmaids got ready in their own rooms after their hair was done at the Spa and then all met in my room to put on their jewelry.\u00a0 At about 4:00 p.m., the photographers and videographer arrived to my room and so did the flowers.\u00a0 They took photos of the rings, flowers, Elizabeth finishing up my makeup, and my mom and godmother tying the back of my dress.\u00a0 We took pictures outside with the bridesmaids as my fianc\u00a9 was taking his photos with the groomsmen on a different floor of the resort.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/09\/09207257_www.antillanafoto.com-4.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-4.jpg\" height=\"526\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/0\/09\/350x700px-LL-09207257_www.antillanafoto.com-4.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 526px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Ceremony \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Beach Gazebo <\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Thanks to a BestDestinationWedding.com I read about and then hired <em>Pastor Rick York<\/em> to officiate the ceremony.\u00a0 It was important to us to have our ceremony in English as we didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to have it translated.\u00a0 Pastor York had emailed me a few ceremonies and we chose the Traditional Ceremony which was beautiful.\u00a0 Dan\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s sister and my brother each did a reading.\u00a0 We also brought a Unity Sand set and Pastor York incorporated that into the ceremony.\u00a0 He was funny and a natural and all of our guests adored him.\u00a0 I highly recommend Pastor York!\u00a0 As I was making my way to the gazebo, there were hundreds of people looking on and surrounding the gazebo which made me feel even more special.\u00a0 It seemed like I had 300 guests versus 30 and they were all so kind wishing us luck and taking photos.\u00a0 I have to check if I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m on You -Tube <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: wingdings\">J<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">\u00a0 I had given Maria a wedding ceremony song CD and she knew which songs to play as members of our bridal party were walking down the aisle \u00e2\u20ac\u201c it was magical.\u00a0 After the ceremony, we made our way to the beach for pictures!\u00a0 We did group photos, family photos, bridal party photos, and just the bride & groom photos.\u00a0 This was so much fun and the list of poses I \u00e2\u20ac\u0153had to have\u00e2\u20ac\u009d were harder to reenact than I thought \u00e2\u20ac\u201c lol.\u00a0 I love the shots that photographers got.\u00a0 As we were taking our photos, the rest of our guests made their way to the lobby to cool off.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_170\"> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/9\/9b\/9b75f4b8_www.antillanafoto.com-217.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-217.jpg\" height=\"233\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/9\/9b\/350x700px-LL-9b75f4b8_www.antillanafoto.com-217.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 233px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_173\"> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Details \u00e2\u20ac\u201c<\/span><\/span><\/strong><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_172\"  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_171\"  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"> Through this website, I met graphic designer Kim Torres; her work is beautiful.\u00a0 I had reached out to Kim earlier in the year as she had gotten married at the Riu Palace Punta Cana in October 2010.\u00a0 I saw her work and hired her to create our Place Cards, Dinner Menus and Wedding Program.\u00a0 I mailed her a swatch with the Guava color and she was able to match the color perfectly.\u00a0 Everyone loved the wedding programs; she had a great idea to attach these on raffia fans which helped keep our guests cool and served as a favor too.\u00a0 She is flexible, easy to work with, meets all of her deadlines, pays attention to detail and helped move me along through the planning.\u00a0 She offered great tips and it was wonderful to get her opinion from her experience.\u00a0 I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m now working with Kim to finish up my guest book.\u00a0 Kim suggested purchasing postcards once I arrived in Punta Cana and having the guests each sign a postcard.\u00a0 We also took a photo with each and every guest and will now incorporate these into the guestbook.\u00a0 You can find Kim on Facebook and check out her work; she\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s amazing!\u00a0 Her profile is listed as <em>KTorresDesig<\/em>n.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_174\"> <a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/5\/52\/529f805d_www.antillanafoto.com-392.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-392.jpg\" height=\"233\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/5\/52\/350x700px-LL-529f805d_www.antillanafoto.com-392.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 233px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Reception \u00e2\u20ac\u201c La Altagracia (Steakhouse) <\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">Our guests made their way back down to the Steakhouse for the reception and took their seats; Maria had placed all of the Place Cards according to our seating arrangement.\u00a0 The MC introduced the Bridal Party and we went right into our first dance.\u00a0 This was immediately followed by the Father-Daughter dance and the Mother-Son dance.\u00a0 We really wanted to get these out of the way as we knew this would be very emotional for our us and our parents.\u00a0 After the dance, we all took our seats and the Restaurant Manager took everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s orders for Dinner.\u00a0 While waiting for the appetizers to come, the Best Man and Maid of Honor gave their speeches.\u00a0 The food was incredible; all of the guests loved it.\u00a0 Appetizers included Seafood on Ice and Salad.\u00a0 For the main course, our guests could choose from (1) Grilled Chicken (2) Rack of Lamb (3) Beef Rib Eye (4) Beef Tenderloin Land & Sea (Surf & Turf).\u00a0 We both got Surf & Turf and it was delicious!\u00a0 As for the wedding cake, Dan chose the flavor.\u00a0 He went with Vanilla cake with a Guaba filling with small chunks of Mango in it.\u00a0 I wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t sure how that was going to taste but it was incredible.\u00a0 Everyone made sure to have a piece of cake at some point during the reception.\u00a0 I chose to add an additional layer, which made it a 3-layer cake versus just two for an additional cost.\u00a0 The DJ played songs off of our playlists but also threw in his own stuff, which we were happy with.\u00a0 Our guests had requests and the DJ had all of the music.\u00a0 At one point we had a Conga line; the MC got a stick and the entire staff and all my guests were doing the limbo.\u00a0 We were having so much fun that we extended the reception for an hour and a half thanks to the DJ and restaurant staff.\u00a0 After all of the non-stop dancing, everyone returned to their rooms and quickly showered and we all met up in the lobby for drinks and the party continued \u00e2\u20ac\u201c it was so much fun!\u00a0 We really enjoyed the night and took it all in \u00e2\u20ac\u201c it was a blast! <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_119\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/f0\/f007cc60_www.antillanafoto.com-443.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-443.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532470\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\">The day after the wedding we walked to the Photo Shop on the Riu property and selected the 150 photos we wanted printed.\u00a0 This is when we decided to upgrade our package and buy the additional photos for the photo DVD.\u00a0 We stayed at the Riu until Friday afternoon, as we were promised our entire photo package and video.\u00a0 Once we picked up everything, we headed to the Iberostar Grand for our honeymoon!<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_0_9_1315308799550_153\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/b4\/b4dd4de0_www.antillanafoto.com-422.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"www.antillanafoto.com-422.jpg\" height=\"526\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/b\/b4\/350x700px-LL-b4dd4de0_www.antillanafoto.com-422.jpeg\" style=\"min-width: 350px; min-height: 526px; display: inline-block\" width=\"350\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <!-- google_ad_section_end --><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"monicakav@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1291906650,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234504.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":298,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"monicak","Id":234504,"Name":"monicak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63342,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95a66800fba721694b12f8d5e187fffc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"My dad walking me down the aisle\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535471\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Bridal Party\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535473\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535475\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Cake\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535477\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Ladies\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535469\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Guys\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535467\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Rings\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535465\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1515367,"PostDate":1315309709,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"My dad walking me down the aisle\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535471\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bridal Party\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535473\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535475\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Cake\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535477\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Ladies\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535469\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Guys\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535467\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Rings\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/535465\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"monicakav@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1291906650,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234504.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":298,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"monicak","Id":234504,"Name":"monicak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63342,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ef6c1b538eb368fe24318fa4a6a91af","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Your pictures are amazing!! Congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1516477,"PostDate":1315448597,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Your pictures are amazing!! Congrats!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jkergen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"137.186.71.240","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1293159900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JayKay","Id":234788,"Name":"JayKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63342,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa1c782be1223076813d757a27198992","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats!!!&amp;nbsp; You looked beautiful!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1519591,"PostDate":1316014494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats!!!\u00a0 You looked beautiful!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaweis8@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1314039510,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244254.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jamie5280","Id":244254,"Name":"Jamie5280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":63342,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5af2a4ec516290e1dca2e7e8af59a66","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; You are absolutely GORGEOUS! Congratulations!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1519595,"PostDate":1316014646,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> You are absolutely GORGEOUS! Congratulations!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chogan7@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1308158942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Bride2012","Id":241180,"Name":"Bride2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63342,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c476990c223b2d2ce027c4db5383d5b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks Ladies!&amp;nbsp; Enjoy the planning, it goes by so fast!!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1519620,"PostDate":1316017586,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks Ladies!\u00a0 Enjoy the planning, it goes by so fast!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"monicakav@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1291906650,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234504.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":298,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"monicak","Id":234504,"Name":"monicak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63342,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d51b927bc086bd7234392ccff889351","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats! Absolutely gorgeous!!! I am getting married at Riu Palace Punta Cana June 2, 2012 and I feel much better after reading this review.&amp;nbsp; I have been seeing so many negative reviews on tripadvisor and was starting to get upset.&amp;nbsp; I know people on tripadvisor can be really picky and complain about minor things but I was still getting worried.&amp;nbsp; How did you like Ibersotar Grand for your honeymoon? Are you glad you chose that resort or would you have done anything different? We were thinking of doing the same thing and going there for our honeymoon...or go to a different island..so hard to decide!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1519851,"PostDate":1316042898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats! Absolutely gorgeous!!! I am getting married at Riu Palace Punta Cana June 2, 2012 and I feel much better after reading this review.\u00a0 I have been seeing so many negative reviews on tripadvisor and was starting to get upset.\u00a0 I know people on tripadvisor can be really picky and complain about minor things but I was still getting worried.\u00a0 How did you like Ibersotar Grand for your honeymoon? Are you glad you chose that resort or would you have done anything different? We were thinking of doing the same thing and going there for our honeymoon...or go to a different island..so hard to decide!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Kristensr1129@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311549830,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242718.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kristen6212","Id":242718,"Name":"kristen6212","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63342,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed9699157fd76c5a29ef91eabf93e074","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you for sharing all about your wedding. The photos are beautiful. My daughter is getting married in December at the Riu Palace Bavaro and since Maria is busy with current weddings, we are finding it difficult to get some of our questions answered. I am wondering if you might help me with a few answers? I am not able to find the price on line&amp;nbsp;for a private&amp;nbsp;reception in the steakhouse. How much was that? And was the cost of the dj\/mc extra? It seems from your description that there was a place to dance in the restaurant. That is great, because the way we have it set up now is a semi private dinner and then paying&amp;nbsp; for&amp;nbsp; the disco for dancing. It would be much better if it were altogether at the restaurant.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you so much for your help.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1621418,"PostDate":1337298146,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you for sharing all about your wedding. The photos are beautiful. My daughter is getting married in December at the Riu Palace Bavaro and since Maria is busy with current weddings, we are finding it difficult to get some of our questions answered. I am wondering if you might help me with a few answers? I am not able to find the price on line\u00a0for a private\u00a0reception in the steakhouse. How much was that? And was the cost of the dj\/mc extra? It seems from your description that there was a place to dance in the restaurant. That is great, because the way we have it set up now is a semi private dinner and then paying\u00a0 for\u00a0 the disco for dancing. It would be much better if it were altogether at the restaurant.<\/p> <p> Thank you so much for your help.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lksparkes@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1337297768,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255508.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saraswati","Id":255508,"Name":"saraswati","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63342,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6efa767ea853e9e8f0759714894b3604","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]saraswati[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thank you for sharing all about your wedding. The photos are beautiful. My daughter is getting married in December at the Riu Palace Bavaro and since Maria is busy with current weddings, we are finding it difficult to get some of our questions answered. I am wondering if you might help me with a few answers? I am not able to find the price on line for a private reception in the steakhouse. How much was that? And was the cost of the dj\/mc extra? It seems from your description that there was a place to dance in the restaurant. That is great, because the way we have it set up now is a semi private dinner and then paying  for  the disco for dancing. It would be much better if it were altogether at the restaurant. \n Thank you so much for your help.[\/quote] \n  Hello!  Sorry it took me so long to respond!  The charge was $600 for a private reception.  The DJ was $400 for 4 hours and the MC was $150.  I loved the DJ and MC - nice guys!  Yes, there is a dance area near the DJ with plenty of room.  Maria was wonderful to work with too!  I will check back frequently in case you have more questions.","Attachments":[],"Id":1630872,"PostDate":1339599805,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>saraswati<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thank you for sharing all about your wedding. The photos are beautiful. My daughter is getting married in December at the Riu Palace Bavaro and since Maria is busy with current weddings, we are finding it difficult to get some of our questions answered. I am wondering if you might help me with a few answers? I am not able to find the price on line\u00a0for a private\u00a0reception in the steakhouse. How much was that? And was the cost of the dj\/mc extra? It seems from your description that there was a place to dance in the restaurant. That is great, because the way we have it set up now is a semi private dinner and then paying\u00a0 for\u00a0 the disco for dancing. It would be much better if it were altogether at the restaurant.<\/p> <p> Thank you so much for your help.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0Hello!\u00a0 Sorry it took me so long to respond!\u00a0 The charge was $600 for a private reception.\u00a0 The DJ was $400 for 4 hours and the MC was $150.\u00a0 I loved the DJ and MC - nice guys!\u00a0 Yes, there is a dance area near the DJ with plenty of room.\u00a0 Maria was wonderful to work with too!\u00a0 I will check back frequently in case you have more questions.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"monicakav@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1291906650,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234504.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":298,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"monicak","Id":234504,"Name":"monicak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63342,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b8def66f45185d73bdcb76c661cdde9","RawContent":"@monicak thanks for sharing what you posted is exactly what I want !! The 600 for the reception did that just cover the rental of the restaurant or food as well? Also did you have the premium bar or just beer and wine that they serve? Sorry for the questions it&#039;s hard to get an answer and when they send me information it&#039;s not in English :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1636229,"PostDate":1340936562,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @monicak thanks for sharing what you posted is exactly what I want !! The 600 for the reception did that just cover the rental of the restaurant or food as well? Also did you have the premium bar or just beer and wine that they serve? Sorry for the questions it's hard to get an answer and when they send me information it's not in English <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jbenitez14@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.57.100.225","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1340246490,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256948.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminB","Id":256948,"Name":"JasminB","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"63342","Title":"Riu Palace Punta Cana Wedding - 07\/20\/11","LastPostDate":1375381768},"Pages":{"TotalItems":14,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
