 guests and need it to be around $100\/person per night for 3-4 nights.&amp;nbsp; My guests cannot afford $250\/night hotels.&amp;nbsp; I am flexible on wedding month as long as its sept, oct, or Nov 2012.&amp;nbsp; Some kids are okay, but I prefer one with more adults.&amp;nbsp; Please help!&amp;nbsp; I am also in NC if that helps for air travel too. some excursions would be nice as well.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; GG&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575671,"PostDate":1327959979,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am looking for an all inclusive hotel on a beautiful beach(clear water) with entertainment throughout the day. will have 10-20 guests and need it to be around $100\/person per night for 3-4 nights.\u00a0 My guests cannot afford $250\/night hotels.\u00a0 I am flexible on wedding month as long as its sept, oct, or Nov 2012.\u00a0 Some kids are okay, but I prefer one with more adults.\u00a0 Please help!\u00a0 I am also in NC if that helps for air travel too. some excursions would be nice as well.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks<\/p> <p> GG<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ggcatlover135@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327959649,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250734.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"himalayan135","Id":250734,"Name":"himalayan135","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65585,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"953392dc26bb5783ecb571669a8160ad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi, welcome to BDW.&amp;nbsp; That sounds like something a travel agent can best assist you with.&amp;nbsp; You might want to try one of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\"&gt;BDW Travel Agents&lt;\/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;They Specialize in Destination weddings. &amp;nbsp;You can&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\"&gt;contact them HERE!&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575923,"PostDate":1327981867,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi, welcome to BDW.\u00a0 That sounds like something a travel agent can best assist you with.\u00a0 You might want to try one of the\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>BDW Travel Agents<\/a>. \u00a0They Specialize in Destination weddings. \u00a0You can\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>contact them HERE!<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrsjamyjones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.254.135","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1168271040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":1000,"PhotoHeight":667,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"starchild","Id":207039,"Name":"starchild","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65585,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3181a6fffbc736b4dd28b61a7f58d624","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; You can always check tripadvisor.com, review the photos, and contact local\/online travel agencies. That&#039;s how I started.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":woot:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\"&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1327982234989_302\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575929,"PostDate":1327982319,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> You can always check tripadvisor.com, review the photos, and contact local\/online travel agencies. That's how I started.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck!\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span alt=\":woot:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1327982234989_302\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"silverspoon5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327967799,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250745.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tunaandocean","Id":250745,"Name":"tunaandocean","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65585,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e30fee8904424a3561c8817cc162861","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; does anyone have know of any hotels that are within this price range in these areas?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; thanks&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; GG&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575948,"PostDate":1327984923,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> does anyone have know of any hotels that are within this price range in these areas?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> thanks<\/p> <p> GG<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ggcatlover135@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327959649,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250734.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"himalayan135","Id":250734,"Name":"himalayan135","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65585,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"548dfefb0dd2e9c94f1ad71ff6e0e178","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; You may check AM Resorts as an option..I mean Dreams , Secrets, Now resorts they have &amp;nbsp;very affordable rates ...you can check prices on line but I highly recommend &amp;nbsp;use a travel agent with experience in Destinations weddings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sandy Planner&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575959,"PostDate":1327988558,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> You may check AM Resorts as an option..I mean Dreams , Secrets, Now resorts they have \u00a0very affordable rates ...you can check prices on line but I highly recommend \u00a0use a travel agent with experience in Destinations weddings.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sandy Planner<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321990068,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65585,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e692fe324fea900f83b40427a5908aa0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Himalayan, I notice you are asking this question in multiple threads and we all suggest consulting a travel agent because that&#039;s probably the best option.&amp;nbsp; We certainly cannot secure rates or do anything other than say what we think a resort may be, but that won&#039;t help you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You have very specific requests and limitations.&amp;nbsp; Consulting someone who books travel professionally is really the way to go, especially someone who books destination wedding travel for a living.&amp;nbsp; I suggest consulting one, seeing which resorts would fit your needs, and deciding from there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575962,"PostDate":1327989108,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Himalayan, I notice you are asking this question in multiple threads and we all suggest consulting a travel agent because that's probably the best option.\u00a0 We certainly cannot secure rates or do anything other than say what we think a resort may be, but that won't help you.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You have very specific requests and limitations.\u00a0 Consulting someone who books travel professionally is really the way to go, especially someone who books destination wedding travel for a living.\u00a0 I suggest consulting one, seeing which resorts would fit your needs, and deciding from there.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrsjamyjones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.254.135","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1168271040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":1000,"PhotoHeight":667,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"starchild","Id":207039,"Name":"starchild","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"65585","Title":"Need help wedding location in Carribean or Mexico..Help!!","LastPostDate":1327989108},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
